            %li
              %p
                Mark Hamilton,
                %em Locally toric manifolds and singular Bohr-Sommerfeld leaves
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eva+Miranda"}> Eva Miranda
                \:
